,"Billable traffic (GB)":"zirga-zirgar da za a iya lissafin ku\u0257i (GB)","Traffic price per GB":"Farashin zirga-zirga a kowane GB","Other fixed charges":"Sauran \u0199ayyadaddun ku\u0257i","Estimated period cost":"An kiyasta farashin lokaci","All prices entered manually. Excludes taxes, tiered discounts, minimum billing and services not listed.":"An shigar da duk farashi da hannu. Ban da haraji, rangwamen da aka tsara, mafi \u0199arancin lissafin ku\u0257i da ayyuka ba a lissafa su ba.","Compute portion":"Lissafin \u0253angaren","Traffic portion":"Sashen zirga-zirga","Session Training Load":"Nauyin Horar da Zaman","Multiply session duration by a perceived-exertion rating.":"ninka tsawon zaman ta hanyar \u0199imar aiki da aka fahimta.","Session duration (minutes)":"Tsawon zaman (minti)","Session RPE from 0 to 10":"Zaman RPE daga 0 zuwa 10","Session load":"Nauyin zaman","Shannon Diversity Index":"Fihirisar Bambancin Shannon","Compare abundance diversity and evenness from category counts.":"Kwatanta bambancin yalwa da daidaito daga \u0199idayar rukuni.","Positive category counts":"Adadin rukuni mai kyau","Shannon diversity H":"Bambancin Shannon H",Evenness:"Daidaito","Effective categories":"Rukuni masu tasiri","Shannon Entropy":"Shannon Entropy","Measure uncertainty in a discrete probability distribution.":"Auna rashin tabbas a cikin rarraba yiwuwar rarrabuwa daban-daban.",Entropy:"Entropy","Effective equally likely outcomes":"Sakamakon da zai iya yin tasiri iri \u0257aya","Sharpe Ratio":"Rabon Kaifi","Compare excess return with total return volatility.":"Kwatanta ribar da ta wuce kima da jimillar canjin dawowa.","Period return (%)":"Dawowar lokaci (%)","Same-period risk-free return (%)":"Dawowar lokaci mara ha\u0257ari (%)","Same-period volatility (%)":"Canjin lokaci \u0257aya (%)","Sharpe ratio":"Rabon Sharpe","Educational estimate using your assumptions; no live rates, tax rules or investment recommendations. Returns can be negative and are not guaranteed. Use matching return periods. This does not annualize or estimate volatility from prices.":"Kimanta ilimi ta amfani da zato; babu farashin rayuwa, \u0199a'idodin haraji ko shawarwarin saka hannun jari. Dawowar na iya zama mara kyau kuma ba a tabbatar da su ba. Yi amfani da lokutan dawowa masu dacewa. Wannan ba ya \u0199ididdige ko kimanta canjin farashi daga farashi.","Significant Figures Rounding":"Zagaye Figures Masu Muhimmanci","Round a numeric value to the selected count of significant figures.":"Zagaye \u0199imar lambobi zuwa \u0199idayar lambobi da aka za\u0253a na adadi masu mahimmanci.","Significant figures":"alkaluma masu mahimmanci","Keep the first n significant digits; trailing display zeros are not measurement precision.":"Ajiye lambobi masu mahimmanci na farko na n; sifili na nuni da ke biye ba daidaiton ma'auni bane.","Simpson Diversity Index":"Simpson Diversity Index","Find the chance that two different sampled items belong to different categories.":"Nemo damar cewa abubuwa biyu daban-daban da aka samo samfurin sun kasance cikin rukuni daban-daban.","Category integer counts":"Adadin Rukunin yana \u0199idaya","Gini\u2013Simpson diversity":"Bambancin Gini\u2013Simpson","SLA Downtime Budget":"SLA Kasafin Kudin Lokacin Hutu","Translate availability percentage into allowed downtime.":"Fassara kaso na samuwa zuwa lokacin rashin aiki da aka yarda.","Availability target (%)":"Manufar Samun Aiki (%)","Days in reporting period":"Kwanaki a lokacin bayar da rahoto","Allowed downtime":"Lokacin rashin aiki da aka yarda","Arithmetic budget only. Contract exclusions, maintenance windows and measurement methods are not applied.":"Kasafin ku\u0257i na lissafi kawai. Ba a amfani da ke\u0253ance kwangila, tagogi na gyara da hanyoyin aunawa ba.","Allowed downtime in seconds":"Lokacin rashin aiki da aka yarda a cikin da\u0199i\u0199a","Sleep Efficiency":"Ingantaccen Barci","Compare estimated time asleep with time spent in bed.":"Kwatanta lokacin barci da lokacin da aka yi a gado.","Time in bed (minutes)":"Lokacin kwanciya (minti)","Sleep onset latency (minutes)":"Lalacewar fara barci (minti)","Awake after sleep onset (minutes)":"Farkawa bayan fara barci (minti)","Sleep efficiency":"Ingantaccen barci","Self-reported estimate; not a sleep-disorder diagnosis or a replacement for a sleep study.":"Kimantawar da aka bayar da rahoton kai; ba gano matsalar barci ko maye gurbin binciken barci ba.","Estimated time asleep":"Kimanta lokacin barci","Slope between Two Points":"Zurfi tsakanin Maki Biyu","Find rise divided by run and identify vertical lines.":"Nemo tashin da aka raba ta hanyar gudu kuma gano layukan tsaye.",Rise:"Tashi",Run:"Gudu","Snell Refraction Angle":"Kusurwar Rage Rage Snell","Apply refraction at a flat interface between two media.":"A shafa refraction a wani wuri mai fa\u0257i tsakanin kafofin watsa labarai guda biyu.","Incident angle from normal (degrees)":"Kusurwar abin da ya faru daga al'ada (digiri)","Refraction angle":"Kusurwar Rage Rage Rage","Solar Energy Production":"Samar da Makamashin Rana","Estimate production using entered peak sun hours and system losses.":"Kimanta yawan samarwa ta amfani da lokutan rana mafi tsayi da asarar tsarin.","Array peak capacity (kW)":"\u0198arfin jeri mafi tsayi (kW)","Average peak sun hours per day":"Matsakaicin lokutan rana mafi tsayi a kowace rana","System losses (%)":"Asarar tsarin (%)","Sun hours are an input assumption, not a live local forecast. Shading, orientation and seasonal variation require site-specific modeling.":"Lokacin rana zato ne na shigarwa, ba hasashen gida kai tsaye ba. Inuwa, daidaitawa da bambancin yanayi suna bu\u0199atar \u0199irar takamaiman wurin.","Average daily energy":"Matsakaicin kuzarin yau da kullun","Sortino Ratio":"Rabon Sortino","Compare return above a target with downside deviation.":"Kwatanta dawowar da ke sama da manufa tare da karkacewar \u0199asa.","Same-period target return (%)":"Dawowar manufa ta lokaci \u0257aya (%)","Same-period downside deviation (%)":"karkacewar \u0199asa iri \u0257aya (%)","Sortino ratio":"Rabon Sortino","Sound Intensity Level":"Matakin \u0198arfin Sauti","Convert sound intensity to a reference-relative decibel level.":"Canza \u0199arfin sauti zuwa matakin decibel mai ala\u0199a da ma'ana.","Sound intensity (W/m\xB2)":"\u0198arfin sauti (W/m\xB2)","Reference intensity (W/m\xB2)":"\u0198arfin tunani (W/m\xB2)","Sound intensity level":"Matakin \u0198arfin sauti","Intensity level is not automatically A-weighted sound pressure or a hearing-exposure assessment.":"Matakin \u0199arfi ba matsi ne na sauti mai nauyin A ko kimanta fallasa ji ba ta atomatik.","Sphere Volume and Surface":"\u0198arar Sphere da Surface","Find volume, surface area and diameter from a sphere\u2019s radius.":"Nemo girma, yankin saman da diamita daga radius na sphere.",Diameter:"Diamita","Elastic Spring Energy":"Makamashin bazara mai laushi","Find stored energy in an ideal linear spring.":"Nemo makamashin da aka adana a cikin ma\u0253u\u0253\u0253ugar layi mai kyau.","Extension or compression (m)":"Tsawaita ko matsewa (m)","Stored elastic energy":"Makamashin roba da aka adana","Spring Oscillation Period":"Lokacin Oscillation na bazara","Find an ideal mass-spring system\u2019s natural period.":"Nemo lokacin halitta na tsarin taro-ma\u0253u\u0253\u0253ugar da ya dace.","Natural period":"Lokacin halitta","Natural frequency":"Mita na halitta","Square Root":"Tushen Mudubi","Find the nonnegative principal square root and its opposite.":"Nemo tushen murabba'i mai mahimmanci mara kyau da akasin haka.","Principal square root":"Babban tushen murabba'i","Negative root":"Tushen mara kyau","Stair Layout":"Tsarin Matakala","Divide total rise into equal risers under an entered height limit.":"Raba jimlar hauhawar zuwa masu hawa daidai a \u0199ar\u0199ashin iyakar tsayi da aka shigar.","Total rise (mm)":"Jimlar hauhawar (mm)","Maximum preferred riser (mm)":"Matsakaicin hawan da aka fi so (mm)","Tread going (mm)":"Tafiya kan takalmi (mm)",